
layout-continent.mjs and mark-kinds.mjs (Phases 45 and 46) change only placements and subzone kinds of an audited map and refuse a wwwroot output; the spec and the kinds file live in the private world-map/layout folder, and replacing the served audited slices is the owner's call (publish-audited.mjs). Regenerate worldmap2.js (scripts/publish-map-renderer.mjs) after any change to render.ts.
mine-terrain.mjs (2026-11-14) mines terrain out of the game-server logs and gives it to an audited map (see docs/shattered-maps/terrain.md); layout-auto.mjs lays out every continent that has no owner spec from its cross-area links (the owner's spec folder is passed with --specs and wins). Both refuse a wwwroot output; the tally and the maps are private data.
